Package: umu-launcher
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: python3, python3-xlib (>= 0.33), python3-urllib3, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: python3-truststore, python3-cbor2, python3-xxhash, apparmor-profiles,
 libgl1-mesa-dri:i386 [amd64], libglx-mesa0:i386 [amd64]
Description: Unified Launcher for Windows games on Linux
 umu runs games with Proton and the Steam Linux Runtime, with the game fixes
 Proton has in Steam, outside of Steam.
 .
 Debian has no python3-pyzstd, so this package carries upstream's vendored
 pyzstd (for delta updates of Proton and the runtime), linked to the system
 libzstd.
